// Author: russrimm
// Display name: Dataverse - API Call Patterns
// Description: SDK vs Web API usage and most-called entity/operation pairs
// Categories: Power Platform
// Resource types: Dataverse
// Topic: Usage Analytics
// Prerequisites: Power Platform admin diagnostic settings connected to Log Analytics workspace

DataverseActivity
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| summarize Calls=count() by EntityName, Operation
| order by Calls desc
| take 30
